<title>UK: Ceval Alimentos sets $100 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ceval Alimentos sets $100 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CEVAL ALIMENTOS</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     11.125    MATURITY   *01.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.505    PAY DATE    01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.505    YIELD     **11.22 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*PUT ON 01.OCT.99 AT 97.75 AND 01.OCT.01 AT 99.00</p>
<p>		 CALL ON 01.OCT.01 AT 99.25</p>
<p>	     **SEMI ANNUAL YIELD</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
